The battle against the ruler of the seas has begun. Yagditha is hiding Midranda and attacking us.

The Black Crystals seem to be connected to Midranda. They give off a very strange signal; they seem to communicate.

Please, hurry!

We must keep doing our work to protect the Pristonian continent!

Take the Black Crystal by hunting the Master Witch on the Shadow Road.
When you are done, come talk to me again.
